            "text": "MAX_REQUEST_BYTES = 24000\n...\n        if role == \"jev\":\n            jev.validate_request(payload, \"openrouter\")\n        ...\n        data = packed(payload).encode()\n        require(len(data) <= MAX_REQUEST_BYTES, \"request_byte_limit\")"
